### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

### Create a first task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
"title": "Do laundry",
"timeWeight": "SHORT",
"location": "HOME"
}

### Create a second task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Study Spring Boot",
  "timeWeight": "SHORT",
  "location": "HOME"
}

### Create a third task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Go for a run",
  "timeWeight": "MEDIUM",
  "location": "OUTSIDE"
}

### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### Get task by valid ID
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### Get task by INVALID ID — expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/999

### Update task 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Study Spring Boot (updated)",
  "timeWeight": "LONG",
  "location": "HOME"
}

### Update MISSING task — expect 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost task",
  "timeWeight": "SHORT",
  "location": "HOME"
}

### Delete task 2
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/2

### Delete ALREADY DELETED task — expect 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/2

### Get all tasks — should only show task 1 now
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks